</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3adb4488-dde2-11f1-8927-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-5a1d0f2e.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3adb4488-dde2-11f1-8927-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-5a1d0f2e.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">635d0d10-dddd-11f1-80a4-9d3b80df4436</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:13:34 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Olivia SALAZAR WINSPEAR</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
